### Next steps (see STARTUP-PERF.md for details)

1. Docker rebuild with TF removed (~1.8s saved)
2. Trim startup warmup (render portion redundant with service thread)
3. EBS provision 500 MB/s ($5-10/mo)
4. Persistent process across container restarts (target 2-3s)

**Why:** Production avatar server for Taiboli. Fast startup = better developer iteration, faster scaling, better student first impression.

**How to apply:** Follow the next steps in STARTUP-PERF.md. PR #38 needs extended soak testing before merge.
